# Controllers

Define endpoints and HTTP request/response logic.

## Task routes (temporary)

- `GET /api/tasks` — retrieve the list of tasks
- `POST /api/task` — create a single task
- `PATCH /api/task/:id` — update a task
- `DELETE /api/task/:id` — delete a task

Singular `/task` on create means one task is created per request. Plural `/tasks` on list matches collection retrieval. These may be unified to fully plural (`/tasks`) once the API stabilizes.
